# A, standing still: slot 7 is selected and slot 7 is the only full one, so the
# search does a full lap and settles where it started.
1820   A
1826   -
# West along the foot of the pool enclosure, then north up the lane at x=110
# until it stops at y=289, east to x=180 and back south to y=655.
1860   Left
1980   Up
2140   Right
2170   Down
# West and down through the gap at x=102, which lands him at (100,711) -- and
# on a zombie. `$1CB8` goes 10 -> 9 around frame 2485.
2400   Left
2435   Down
# X: the kit is spendable now. Slot 7 -> 0, the array is empty, and the tail
# `JMP $EAA8` stores $FFFF over the 7.
2520   X
2526   -
# A: from $FFFF, which is the branch nothing else takes.
2540   A
2546   -
# North again -- out of the zombie, up the x=180 lane to y=313 -- and west
# through the key at (128,310). Frame ~2825, and it auto-selects.
2560   Up
